      "side": 1,
      "message": "Collecting `aiApprovalUuids` from `approvals.values()` misses cases where the original approval is not present in `approvals`:\n1. If the original patch set where the AI vote was granted is later deleted (`PatchSetState.DELETED`), `parse()` returns early at line 576 (`if (deletedPatchSets.contains(psId)) { return; }`) before `parseApproval` is reached, while the copied approval on a newer patch set remains.\n2. `approvals` only retains the latest `PatchSetApproval.Builder` per `(psId, accountId, labelId)` (via `putIfAbsent` during reverse-chronological walk), so if an approval on an older patch set was later overwritten on that patch set without updating a follow-up patch set\u0027s copy, the original UUID is no longer in `approvals.values()`.",
